        "original_id": "5232c40a-c2cf-5913-b219-c913e9a87cdb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Miami Dolphins, New England Patriots, Indianapolis Colts\n- Seasons: 1978 Miami Dolphins season, 2004 New England Patriots season, 2005 Indianapolis Colts season\n- Organizations: National Football League\n- Topics: playoffs, records\n\nFacts:\n- The 1978 Miami Dolphins season ended with the Miami Dolphins returning to the NFL playoffs for the first time since 1974 and finishing with an 11–5 record.\n- A record associated with the 1978 Miami Dolphins season was later equalled by the 2004 New England Patriots.\n- The 2004 New England Patriots season was the franchise's 35th season in the National Football League and 45th season overall.\n- Another record associated with the 1978 Miami Dolphins season was later surpassed by the 2005 Indianapolis Colts.",
